10. SERVERLESS ARCHITECTURE
--------------------------------------------------------

>> Serverless Advantages
- No server management - infrastructure AWS manage karta hai.
- Auto-scaling built-in, pay only for actual usage (no idle cost).
- Faster time-to-market, kam operational overhead.

>> Stateless Architecture
- Har request/invocation independent hoti hai, function ke andar koi persistent state nahi rakhte.
- State ko external stores me rakha jata hai (DynamoDB, S3, ElastiCache).
- Isse horizontal scaling easy hota hai.

>> Scalability
- Serverless automatically scale karta hai demand ke basis pe (zero se hazaro concurrent executions tak) bina manual intervention ke.
- Concurrency limits aur throttling ka dhyan rakhna padta hai downstream resources (DB connections) overload na ho.

>> Cold Starts
- (Already Lambda section me cover kiya) - serverless architecture ka ek trade-off hai, especially latency-sensitive apps ke liye consideration.

>> Cost Optimization
- Right-sizing memory allocation (memory/cost/performance balance).
- Unused resources clean karna, provisioned concurrency sirf jaha zaroori ho wahi use karna.
- S3 lifecycle policies, DynamoDB on-demand vs provisioned capacity choose karna based on traffic pattern.

>> Security
- Least privilege IAM roles har function ke liye.
- Secrets ko env vars me plain text me na rakhna - Secrets Manager/Parameter Store use karna.
- Input validation, encryption at rest & in transit.

>> Monitoring
- CloudWatch Metrics (invocations, errors, duration, throttles) sabhi services ke automatically track hote hain.
- Custom metrics bhi publish kar sakte hain business-specific KPIs ke liye.

>> Logging
- CloudWatch Logs me automatically Lambda logs jaate hain (console.log output).
- Structured logging (JSON format) best practice hai taaki logs easily searchable/parseable ho (CloudWatch Insights ke saath).

>> Failure Handling
- Retries, DLQs, circuit breakers, idempotency - sab combine karke resilient system banate hain jo partial failures gracefully handle kare.
- Distributed system me failure "normal" maana jata hai - design karte waqt failure-first mindset rakhna chahiye.

